  "notes": "Needs MIDI FLT > CTRL CHG = ENABLE. CC numbers are the factory CC MAP (GLOBAL > CC MAP can change them). CCs act on the timbre of their channel: timbre 1 on the global channel, timbre 2 on T2MIDI.CH in MULTI mode. NRPNs (arp, voice mode, vocoder, virtual patch) go to the global channel and use only the Data Entry MSB. Values from the German manual's MIDI chapter, untested. Filter 1 type morphs: 0 LPF24, 32 LPF12, 64 HPF, 96 BPF, 127 Thru. Key track is centred (0–127 = −2…+2). Filter 2 has no effect with routing Single.",
